{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:44:00Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"where it gets difficult for me, is when they complain about people going solo ", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:44:31Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":" but i dont disagree... i personally dont see the appeal in clubbing defenseless seals", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:44:39Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"actual pvp, sure ", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:44:51Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"but again - thats just my opinion, and i'm sure they have a lot of fun doing what they're doing", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:44:57Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"lots of different ways to play the game, like i say", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:45:50Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"then you get the really annoying antagonising ones who spam the chat - but thats different again... they make the gankers look even worse than they already do", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:45:55Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"good thing ATR is in the game and bounties raise exponentionally", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:47:00Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"yeah i mean pvp never interested me in ED really... its much more fun in something like IL-2 where players are more (to an extent!) evenly matched", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:47:57Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"$npc_name_decorate:#name=juri;", "From_Localised":"juri", "Message":"$Trader_OnEnemyShipDetection02;", "Message_Localised":"I strongly advise you against this.", "Channel":"npc" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:48:06Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"p5dd4", "Message":"Jon you are right.  but I m  not so tolerant to ganking shit", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:48:34Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"I do PvE bounty hunting and even a fully engineered PvE Corvette can't really do much against a plasma spamming FDL", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:48:52Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"so PvP is a REEEALY narrow topic", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:49:10Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"p5dd4", "Message":"I really have my way to enjoy the game since 2014 and pvp just not my thing", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:49:44Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"but try to bring pack hound missles and they begin to cry (at least the one I killed in an exploration anaconda did)", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:10Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"because they pack everyting into hull", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:22Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"p5dd4", "Message":"especially I dont care about   ppl in pvp  specific loadout   hunting down haulers", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:33Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"oh yeah", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:43Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"neurq: yeah i absolutely do not understand the appeal there... i really dont ", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:46Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"$npc_name_decorate:#name=Bernt Louis;", "From_Localised":"Bernt Louis", "Message":"$Commuter_AuthorityScan05;", "Message_Localised":"On what grounds are you scanning this vessel, officer?", "Channel":"npc" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:56Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"I kinda understand roleplayer pirates that let ppl go after they steal from them", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:50:59Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"it may be fun", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:51:08Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"oh roleplaying pirates are awesome, and fun", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:51:09Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"but not hauler ganking", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:51:11Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"and they dont kill you", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:51:24Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"++", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:51:37Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"shieldless hauler ganking is just... *shrug* i really dont get it... its not even like eve either where your death is a detriment to your squad or whatever", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:52:10Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"i mean some of them are assholes, obviously... but some of them seem really decent!... so i must be missing something i guess, in terms of enjoyment?? I just dont understand it", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:52:23Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"but yeah, dont be surprised when we all go to solo, and certainly dont complain about it ", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:52:30Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"ya know?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:53:02Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"and the absolutely worst think is system locking. They already locked one trabilizer ship", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:53:17Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"what do you mean?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:53:28Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"$npc_name_decorate:#name=Sepi Collstar;", "From_Localised":"Sepi Collstar", "Message":"$Trader_OnEnemyShipDetection05;", "Message_Localised":"We don't have to do this!", "Channel":"npc" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:03Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"they killed so many ppl that the system's security dropped to lockdown", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:14Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"ah shit okay", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:18Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"and now you can't buy from the ship", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:27Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"you cant? ju st bought a full load", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:43Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"e46gm", "Message":"yes but it happened somewhere else", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:46Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"ah okay", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:50Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"i mean yeah thats pretty shitty", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:50Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"$npc_name_decorate:#name=Asta Riber Stegger;", "From_Localised":"Asta Riber Stegger", "Message":"$Trader_OnEnemyShipDetection03;", "Message_Localised":"Oh no you don't!", "Channel":"npc" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:54:53Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"to say the least", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:55:09Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"and i'm sure they're not even leaning into some roleplay lore reason either", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:55:18Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"just... gameplay dos attack, haha", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:55:43Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"anyway, i'm done moaning for now", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:55:50Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"told myself i'd not let it bother me so much anymore", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:55:56Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"it certainly aint gunna change", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:56:31Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"(although fdev actually putting a lore-based punishment system in for murder wouldn't be a bad idea, having system security hunt them down and attack them etc etc - i'm sure that'd be fun for them too)", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-27T17:56:36Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"qrf5k", "Message":"but we got what we got!", "Channel":"starsystem" }
